# D-Card API — guests (host and committee manage; treasurer reads)
# docs/design/features/guests-and-cards.md. Run top to bottom.


### Setup: provision users
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{treasurerToken}}

### Setup: create an event
# @name event
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "planKey": "kawaida", "eventTypeKey": "wedding", "title": "Guests demo", "startsAt": "2026-12-12T15:00:00+03:00", "contactName": "Asha", "contactPhone": "0754123456" }

> {%
  client.global.set("eventId", response.body.id);
%}

### Add a guest (form)
# Body: name (1–120), phone, cardType single|double (default single), partnerName (double only), consent (must be true, MSG-14).
# One Person per phone platform-wide; one invitation per person per event (GST-2).
# 201 → { "guest": Guest, "existing": false }
# 200 → { "guest": <the existing invitation>, "existing": true } when the phone is already invited.
# 422 consent_required · 422 invalid_phone · 403 treasurer/stranger · 409 event cancelled/completed.
# Guest: { id, eventId, personId, name, phone "2557…", partnerName, cardType, totalEntries 1|2, status pending|issued|cancelled, cardNumber, issuedAt, createdAt, updatedAt }
# @name addGuest
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/guests
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Juma Salum", "phone": "0713 000 001", "cardType": "double", "partnerName": "Neema", "consent": true }

> {%
  client.global.set("guestId", response.body.guest.id);
%}

### Same phone again → 200 existing: true (no duplicate)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/guests
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Juma S.", "phone": "+255713000001", "consent": true }

### Without consent → 422 consent_required
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/guests
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Zawadi", "phone": "0713000002", "consent": false }

### Add many guests (phone contacts in the D-Card app, GST-6)
# Body: guests[1–500] of { name, phone, cardType?, partnerName? } + consent. Invalid rows are reported, not fatal.
# One guest_consent record with source "contacts".
# 201 → { "added": [Guest], "existing": [Guest], "invalid": [{ "index", "phone", "reason": "invalid_phone" }] } · 200 when nothing new.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/guests/bulk
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guests": [
    { "name": "Bahati", "phone": "+255 713 100 001" },
    { "name": "Chausiku", "phone": "0713-100-002", "cardType": "double", "partnerName": "Daudi" },
    { "name": "Juma again", "phone": "0713000001" },
    { "name": "Broken", "phone": "12345" }
  ],
  "consent": true
}

### List guests (host, committee, treasurer)
# Newest first, keyset pagination. Query: q (name or ≥ 3 phone digits), limit 1–200 (default 50), cursor (from nextCursor).
# 200 → { "guests": [Guest], "nextCursor": "…" | null } · 422 bad limit/cursor.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/guests?limit=2
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}

### Search by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/guests?q=chau
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}

### Search by phone digits
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/guests?q=0713 100
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}

### Treasurer: read-only once they hold the role (accept an invite in 06-team.http)
# Without a role on this event (as in a fresh run of this file) → 403 forbidden.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/guests
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{treasurerToken}}

### Edit a pending guest (host, committee)
# Any of: name, partnerName, cardType. Double ↔ single updates totalEntries. Audited.
# 200 → Guest · 409 once the card is issued (card type is fixed, GST-9) · 404 unknown guest.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/guests/{{guestId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Juma Salum Hamisi", "partnerName": "Neema Juma" }

### Remove a pending guest (host, committee)
# 204 · 409 once issued (cancel the card instead) · 404 unknown.
# @name toRemove
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/guests
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Temporary", "phone": "0713999999", "consent": true }

> {%
  client.global.set("toRemoveGuestId", response.body.guest.id);
%}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/guests/{{toRemoveGuestId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
